For coding tasks, load and apply the available `token-efficiency` skill before
substantive work, using its installed location shown by the host.
Reuse the instructions while they remain in context; reload if lost or changed.
Load its measurement reference only for benchmarking or savings claims.
Preserve required checks, correctness, and the user's requested detail.
If the skill is unavailable, mention that once and continue the task; do not
install anything automatically. Honor an explicit request to stop applying it.
